  "summary_text": "Scope session with Lumen Education's VP of Admissions and CIO. Scope agreed: 120 users across admissions, marketing and management, integrations with the Campus One student system, Mailwave and WhatsApp, live by May 2027, budget 110-130k USD a year. They are also evaluating Clarion Sales Cloud. Lumen asked for a proposal by 13 November.",
  "summary_markdown": "Scope session with Lumen Education's VP of Admissions and CIO. Scope agreed: 120 users across admissions, marketing and management, integrations with the Campus One student system, Mailwave and WhatsApp, live by May 2027, budget 110-130k USD a year. They are also evaluating Clarion Sales Cloud. Lumen asked for a proposal by 13 November.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Good afternoon, Daniela, Marcos. Pedro is with me again. The plan for today is to agree the scope, so we can prepare the proposal.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:14Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Perfect. We blocked the full hour, so let's use it.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:16Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:20Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "And I brought my list of technical questions, as promised.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:24Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:28Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Great. Daniela, let's start with the users. Who would use the CRM?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:33Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:38Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Our admissions counsellors are our sales team, eighty of them across the six campuses. Marketing has twenty-five people running the campaigns. And fifteen managers in the leadership team need the reports. So one hundred and twenty users.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:00:54Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "And how do the counsellors work today?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:23Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Each campus has its own spreadsheets, and a lot happens on WhatsApp. We have no idea how many prospects we lose between the first contact and the enrolment.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:25Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:36Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Our target for next year is to lift the conversion from first contact to enrolment from eight to twelve percent.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:50Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:01:58Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "What must the CRM do from day one?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:03:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:03:13Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Capture the leads from our campaigns, give each counsellor a follow-up list, show the enrolment funnel per campus, and keep the WhatsApp conversations with the prospect's record.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:03:14Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:03:24Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "On integrations, it has to connect to Campus One, our student information system, because that is where an enrolment becomes official. And to Mailwave, the email tool marketing uses.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:05:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:05:51Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Pedro Almeida"
      },
      "text": "Both have APIs we've worked with. What about WhatsApp?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:06:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:06:08Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "Yes, WhatsApp too, through the official business account.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:06:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:06:13Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "My main concern is student data. It must stay in Brazil, and we need a data protection assessment before anything goes live.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:09:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:09:38Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Pedro Almeida"
      },
      "text": "Our data centre for Brazilian clients is in São Paulo, and we can support the assessment.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:09:51Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:09:57Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "How will the decision be made on your side?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:23Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "First an IT security review and the data protection assessment. Then Daniela signs, and the board approves anything above one hundred and fifty thousand dollars a year.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:25Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:35Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "On the paperwork, procurement will need your standard contract and the data processing agreement two weeks before the signature.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:50Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:12:57Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "And the budget?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:13:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:13:41Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "We've approved between one hundred and ten and one hundred and thirty thousand dollars a year.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:13:44Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:13:50Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Are you evaluating other options?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:15:05Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:15:07Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "We're also looking at Clarion Sales Cloud. To be honest, they're cheaper, but their WhatsApp integration is weak.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:15:09Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:15:16Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "When does it need to be live?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:17:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:17:33Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "The enrolment campaign for the second semester starts in June, so we need it live by May 2027.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:17:34Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:17:41Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "Off topic, but did anyone watch the match last night? I still can't believe that penalty.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:24:10Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:24:15Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Pedro Almeida"
      },
      "text": "Don't remind me.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:24:16Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:24:17Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "So the scope is clear for us: one hundred and twenty users across admissions, marketing and management, the Campus One and Mailwave integrations, and WhatsApp.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:46:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:46:40Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Please send us a proposal on that scope.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:46:48Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:46:51Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Will do. I'll send the proposal by Friday the 13th, and we can review it together on Tuesday the 17th.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:46:57Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:47:05Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Tuesday the 17th works.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:47:08Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:47:10Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Marcos Antunes"
      },
      "text": "And I will send you our security questionnaire by Monday.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:47:15Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:47:19Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Daniela Freitas"
      },
      "text": "Thank you both, this was very productive.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-05T17:51:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-05T17:51:43Z"
    }
  ]
}
